---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Evaluators DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo evaluator search
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Resolve namespace, query, and bounded limit
    Vigilo->>DB: Read bounded metadata page under current caller context
    DB-->>Vigilo: Matching summaries, possibly empty

    loop More byte-bounded pages needed to fill CLI limit
        Vigilo->>DB: Continue by filter-bound logical position
        DB-->>Vigilo: Next metadata page
    end
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build data/meta payload
    Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    deactivate Vigilo
